      *################################################################*02090099
      * Control your database updates/queries from here. use Perform   *02100099
      * statements to the different database parts that will be        *02110099
      * accessed in such a way that one section only controls update of*02120099
      * one database element.                                          *02130099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*02140099
       G000-Update                       Section.                       02150099
      *                                                                 02160099
      * Checking In_Progress, Register_Date and Last_Saved_Date         02170099
      * from TF_Main_Contract.                                          02180099
      *                                                                 02190099
           Perform G100-Read-Main-Contract                              02200099
      *                                                                 02210099
           If RTFRE120-I-Operation-Type-D =    'SHOW'                   02220099
           Or RTFRE120-I-Operation-Type-D =    'SHOW-AGENT'             02230099
             Set SW-Actual               To    True                     02240099
      *                                                                 02250099
           Else                                                         02260099
             If R115IMC0-In-Progress-Yes                                02270099
               Set SW-Work               To    True                     02280099
             Else                                                       02290099
               Set SW-Actual             To    True                     02300099
             End-If                                                     02310099
      *                                                                 02320099
           End-If                                                       02330099
      *                                                                 02340099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*02350099
      *                                                                 02360099
      * Removed 09.2000, not in use (NDL)                               02370099
      * Added 03.2012 to check access to extra fields                   02371099
           Move 'CHARGE-TEXT-2012'       To    Ws-Sc-Code               02372099
           Perform G200-Read-Sys-Code                                   02380099
           If R7919999-Return-OK                                        02380199
              Set SW-Access-Text         To    True                     02380299
           End-If                                                       02380399
      *                                                                 02380499
           Move 'CHARGE-AMB-2012'        To    Ws-Sc-Code               02380599
           If R7919999-Return-OK                                        02380699
              Set SW-Access-AM-Base      To    True                     02380799
           End-If                                                       02380899
           Perform G200-Read-Sys-Code                                   02381099
      *                                                                 02390099
      * If the contract is a Letter of Credit:                          02400099
      *                                                                 02410099
      *    If R115ISC0-Contract-Name     =     'LC'                     02420099
      *                                                                 02430099
      * - Reading Expiry_Date from TF_Event_Info.                       02440099
      *                                                                 02450099
      *      Perform G300-Read-Event-Info                               02460099
      *                                                                 02470099
      * - Computing the number of three-month periods from              02480099
      *   register date to expiry date.                                 02490099
      *                                                                 02500099
      *      Perform G400-Compute-Periods                               02510099
      *      Divide  R7919020-Ut-Ant-Mnd   by    3                      02520099
      *      Giving  WA-3m-Periods         rounded                      02530099
      *                                                                 02540099
      *    End-If                                                       02550099
      *                                                                 02560099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*02570099
      *                                                                 02580099
      * Finding out if there has been a change in the Contract Amount.  02590099
      * Removed 09.2000, not in use (NDL)                               02600099
      *                                                                 02610099
      *    If RTFRE120-I-Contract-Type-D =     'ILC' or 'ELC'           02620099
      *      Perform G500-Read-Contract-Amount                          02630099
      *    End-If                                                       02640099
      *                                                                 02650099
      * Reading and processing charges.                                 02660099
      *                                                                 02670099
           If RTFRE120-I-Operation-Type-D = 'SHOW-AGENT'                02680099
             Perform H400-Get-Agent-Commission                          02690099
           Else                                                         02700099
             Perform H000-Get-Charges                                   02710099
           End-If                                                       02720099
           .                                                            02730099
      *                                                                 02740099
       G000-Update-Ex.                                                  02750099
           Exit.                                                        02760099
                                                                        02770099
      *################################################################*02780099
       G100-Read-Main-Contract           Section.                       02790099
      *                                                                 02800099
      *                                                                 02810099
           Initialize                          R115IMC0-Main-Contract   02820099
           Set   R115IMC0-Version        To    True                     02830099
           Set   R115IMC0-In-Actual      To    True                     02840099
           Set   R115IMC0-In-Select      To    True                     02850099
      *                                                                 02860099
           Move  RTFRE120-I-Fin-Inst-No-D                               02870099
                                         To    R115IMC0-In-Fin-Inst-No  02880099
           Move  RTFRE120-I-Contract-Type-D                             02890099
                                         To    R115IMC0-In-Contract-Type02900099
           Move  RTFRE120-I-Contract-No-D                               02910099
                                         To    R115IMC0-In-Contract-No  02920099
      *                                                                 02930099
           Call  'F115IMC0'              Using R115IMC0-Main-Contract   02940099
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      02950099
           End-Call                                                     02960099
      *                                                                 02970099
           Evaluate True                                                02980099
             When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 02990099
               Move  'G101'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       03000099
               Move  'FM'                To    R400CH01-Message-Code    03010099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       03020099
      *                                                                 03030099
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 03040099
               Move  'G102'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       03050099
               Move  'FM'                To    R400CH01-Message-Code    03060099
               Perform Z700-Error-AE                                    03070099
      *                                                                 03080099
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    03090099
               Continue                                                 03100099
      *                                                                 03110099
           End-Evaluate                                                 03120099
           .                                                            03130099
      *                                                                 03140099
       G100-Read-Main-Contract-Ex.                                      03150099
           Exit.                                                        03160099
                                                                        03170099
      *################################################################*03180099
       G200-Read-Sys-Code                Section.                       03190099
      *                                                                 03200099
           Initialize                          R115ISC0-Sys-Code        03210099
           Set   R115ISC0-Version        To    True                     03220099
           Set   R115ISC0-In-Select      To    True                     03230099
           Move  'PRODUCT-AVAIL '        To    R115ISC0-In-ST-Type      03240099
           Move  RTFRE120-I-Fin-Inst-No-D                               03250099
                                         To    R115ISC0-In-Fin-Inst-No  03260099
           Move  Ws-Sc-Code              To    R115ISC0-In-SC-Code      03280099
      *                                                                 03290099
           Call  'F115ISC0'              Using R115ISC0-Sys-Code        03300099
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      03310099
           End-Call                                                     03320099
      *                                                                 03330099
           Evaluate True                                                03340099
             When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 03350099
               Move  'FM'                To    R400CH01-Message-Code    03360099
               Move  'G201'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       03370099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       03380099
      *                                                                 03390099
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 03400099
               Continue                                                 03401099
      *                                                                 03440099
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    03450099
               Continue                                                 03460099
      *                                                                 03470099
           End-Evaluate                                                 03480099
      *                                                                 03490099
           .                                                            03500099
      *                                                                 03510099
       G200-Read-Sys-Code-Ex.                                           03520099
           Exit.                                                        03530099
