                                         To    R115IPA0-In-PA-Seq-No    04950099
      *                                                                 04960099
           Call  'F115IPA0'              Using R115IPA0-Part-Amount     04970099
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      04980099
           End-Call                                                     04990099
      *                                                                 05000099
           Evaluate True                                                05010099
             When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 05020099
               Move  'FM'                To    R400CH01-Message-Code    05030099
               Move  'G501'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       05040099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       05050099
                                                                        05060099
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 05070099
               Move  'FM'                To    R400CH01-Message-Code    05080099
               Move  'G502'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       05090099
               Perform Z700-Error-AE                                    05100099
      *                                                                 05110099
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    05120099
               Continue                                                 05130099
      *                                                                 05140099
           End-Evaluate                                                 05150099
           .                                                            05160099
      *                                                                 05170099
       G600-Read-Contract-Amount-Ex.                                    05180099
           Exit.                                                        05190099
      *                                                                 05200099
      *################################################################*05210099
       H000-Get-Charges                  Section.                       05220099
      *                                                                 05230099
      * Checking which charges are permissible and which charges        05240099
      * are already registered.                                         05250099
      *                                                                 05260099
           Perform H100-List-Charges                                    05270099
      *                                                                 05280099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*05290099
      * Working through the list of permissible charges.                05300099
      *                                                                 05310099
           Perform H200-Process-Charge-List                             05320099
      *                                                                 05330099
      *                                                                 05340099
           Perform until                                                05350099
           not   R115L070-Read-To         <     R115L070-No-Read        05360099
                                                                        05370099
             Compute                            R115L070-In-Read-From   05380099
                 =                              R115L070-Read-From      05390099
                 +                              1                       05400099
             End-Compute                                                05410099
      *                                                                 05420099
             Perform H130-Call-LMOD-Comp-Charge                         05430099
             Perform H200-Process-Charge-List                           05440099
      *                                                                 05450099
           End-Perform                                                  05460099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*05470099
