      *    Else                                                         05560099
             Move  Zeroes                To    WA-Period                05570099
      *                                                                 05580099
      *    End-If                                                       05590099
           .                                                            05600099
      *                                                                 05610099
       H000-Get-Charges-Ex.                                             05620099
           Exit.                                                        05630099
