           Evaluate True                                                05740099
             When SW-Actual                                             05750099
               Set   R115L070-In-Actual  To    True                     05760099
             When SW-Work                                               05770099
               Set   R115L070-In-Work    To    True                     05780099
           End-Evaluate                                                 05790099
      *                                                                 05800099
