                                         To    R115L070-In-Contract-Type05880099
           Move  RTFRE120-I-Contract-No-D                               05890099
                                         To    R115L070-In-Contract-No  05900099
      *                                                                 05910099
           If RTFRE120-I-Part-Amount-No-I =    'U'                      05920099
             Move  RTFRE120-I-Part-Amount-No-D                          05930099
                                         To    R115L070-In-PA-Seq-No    05940099
           End-If                                                       05950099
