                                         Not = Zeroes                   06550099
                       Perform I100-Stored-Values                       06560099
      *                                                                 06570099
               Else                                                     06580099
                       Perform I200-Default-Values                      06590099
      *                                                                 06600099
               End-If                                                   06610099
