      *      -----------------------------------------------------------10880099
             When True                                                  10890099
             also True                                                  10900099
             also True                                                  10910099
      * Both parties are charged. - Not allowed!                        10920099
               Move  'TF-SY-DUPLICATE-CHARGE'                           10930099
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code    10940099
               Move  'VAR1'              To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)  10950099
               Move  WA-Charge-Type      To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1) 10960099
               Move  'I361'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       10970099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       10980099
      *                                                                 10990099
      *      -----------------------------------------------------------11000099
             When True                                                  11010099
             also True                                                  11020099
             also False                                                 11030099
      * Overwriting previous output data.                               11040099
               Set   SW-Overwrite        To    True                     11050099
      *                                                                 11060099
      *      -----------------------------------------------------------11070099
             When True                                                  11080099
             also False                                                 11090099
             also True                                                  11100099
      * Keeping previous output, ignoring new data.                     11110099
               Set   SW-Ignore           To    True                     11120099
      *                                                                 11130099
      *      -----------------------------------------------------------11140099
             When True                                                  11150099
             also False                                                 11160099
             also False                                                 11170099
      * Neither party is charged. Overwriting previous output data.     11180099
               Move  Space               To    WA-Paying-Party          11190099
               Set   SW-Overwrite        To    True                     11200099
      *                                                                 11210099
      *      -----------------------------------------------------------11220099
             When other                                                 11230099
      * Tentatively writing the data to the output fields.              11240099
               Set   SW-Write-New        To    True                     11250099
      *      -----------------------------------------------------------11260099
      *                                                                 11270099
           End-Evaluate                                                 11280099
      *                                                                 11290099
      * Continue the process of outputing iterative fields.             11300099
           Perform U100-Iter-Out-Fields                                 11310099
           .                                                            11320099
      *                                                                 11330099
       I360-Normal-Row-Suppression-Ex.                                  11340099
           Exit.                                                        11350099
                                                                        11360099
      *################################################################*11370099
      * Perform your move of data fields that must be delivered back   *11380099
