      *################################################################*12070099
       U100-Iter-Out-Fields              Section.                       12080099
      *                                                                 12090099
      * Supressing rows from the R115L070 list.                         12100099
      *                                                                 12110099
           If  SW-Overwrite                                             12120099
           or  SW-Ignore                                                12130099
             Add   -1                    To    WA-No-Read               12140099
             Add   -1                    To    WA-Count-Rows            12150099
           End-If                                                       12160099
      *                                                                 12170099
           Perform U130-Adjust-Parameters                               12180099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*12190099
      * When settling charges that are calculated from a percentage,    12200099
      * the user is allowed to override the amount (rather than the     12210099
      * percentage). When that is the case, both percentage and amount  12220099
      * are stored in the database, but the percentage must be hidden   12230099
      * from the user.                                                  12240099
      * 12.09.2000.  Fjernet av ndl                                     12250099
      *    If (R115L070-MethCalc-Pct-Of-CA(WA-Ind)                      12260099
      *    or  R115L070-MethCalc-Pct-Of-PA(WA-Ind))                     12270099
      *    and RTFRE120-I-Operation-Type-D(1:7)                         12280099
      *                                  =     'SETTLE-'                12290099
      *        Move  Zero                To    WA-Percent-Comm          12300099
      *    End-If                                                       12310099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*12320099
      * 19/10/1999. Forel�big fjernet. Avventer. HB.                    12330099
      *                                                                 12340099
      * For Contract Type = Import Letter of Credit, no Issuance        12350099
      * Commision can be charged if the Contract Amount has been        12360099
      * changed.                                                        12370099
      *                                                                 12380099
      *    If RTFRE120-I-Contract-Type-D =     'ILC'                    12390099
      *    and R115L070-Charge-Type(WA-Ind) =  'ISSUANCE-COMMISION'     12400099
      *    and R115ICA0-Curr-O-Amount    not = R115ICA0-Original-Amount 12410099
      *        Move  Zero                To    WA-Amount                12420099
      *        Move  Zero                To    WA-Percent-Comm          12430099
      *    End-If                                                       12440099
      *                                                                 12450099
      * Likewise, for Contract Type = Export Letter of Credit, no       12460099
      * Confirm Commision can be charged if the Contract Amount has     12470099
      * been changed.                                                   12480099
      *                                                                 12490099
      *    If RTFRE120-I-Contract-Type-D =     'ELC'                    12500099
      *    and R115L070-Charge-Type(WA-Ind) =  'CONFIRM-COMMISION'      12510099
      *    and R115ICA0-Curr-O-Amount    not = R115ICA0-Original-Amount 12520099
      *        Move  Zero                To    WA-Amount                12530099
      *        Move  Zero                To    WA-Percent-Comm          12540099
      *    End-If                                                       12550099
      *                                                                 12560099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*12570099
      * We are only interested in the rows between WA-Read-From and -To.12580099
      *                                                                 12590099
           If  not WA-Count-Rows         <     WA-Read-From             12600099
           and not WA-Count-Rows         >     WA-Read-To               12610099
           and not SW-Ignore                                            12620099
               Perform U160-Iter-Output                                 12630099
           End-If                                                       12640099
           .                                                            12650099
      *                                                                 12660099
       U100-Iter-Out-Fields-Ex.                                         12670099
           Exit.                                                        12680099
                                                                        12690099
      *################################################################*12700099
       U130-Adjust-Parameters            Section.                       12710099
      *                                                                 12720099
           If not RTFRE120-B-Read-From-I =     'U'                      12730099
             Move 'U'                    To    RTFRE120-B-Read-From-I   12740099
             Move +0                     To    RTFRE120-B-Read-From-D   12750099
           End-If                                                       12760099
      *                                                                 12770099
           If not RTFRE120-B-Read-To-I   =     'U'                      12780099
             Move 'U'                    To    RTFRE120-B-Read-To-I     12790099
             Move +0                     To    RTFRE120-B-Read-To-D     12800099
           End-If                                                       12810099
      *                                                                 12820099
      * Setting the Read-From and -To parameters.                       12830099
      *                                                                 12840099
           Set  RTFRE120-O-Charge-Type-M To    True                     12850099
      *                                                                 12860099
           Evaluate RTFRE120-B-Read-From-D                              12870099
           also     RTFRE120-B-Read-To-D                                12880099
      *      ------------------------------------------------------     12890099
             When +0                                                    12900099
             also +0                                                    12910099
      *                                                                 12920099
               Move +1                   To    WA-Read-From             12930099
      *                                                                 12940099
               If  WA-No-Read            >     RTFRE120-O-Charge-Type-A 12950099
                 Move  RTFRE120-O-Charge-Type-A                         12960099
                                         To    WA-Read-To               12970099
               Else                                                     12980099
                 Move  WA-No-Read        To    WA-Read-To               12990099
               End-If                                                   13000099
      *      ------------------------------------------------------     13010099
             When any                                                   13020099
             also +0                                                    13030099
      *                                                                 13040099
               Move  RTFRE120-B-Read-From-D                             13050099
                                         To    WA-Read-From             13060099
      *                                                                 13070099
               Compute                         WA-Difference            13080099
                   =                           WA-No-Read               13090099
                   -                           WA-Read-From             13100099
               End-Compute                                              13110099
      *                                                                 13120099
               If  WA-Difference         >     RTFRE120-O-Charge-Type-A 13130099
                 Compute                       WA-Read-To               13140099
                     =                         RTFRE120-O-Charge-Type-A 13150099
                     +                         WA-Read-From             13160099
                 End-Compute                                            13170099
      *                                                                 13180099
               Else                                                     13190099
                 Compute                       WA-Read-To               13200099
                     =                         WA-Difference            13210099
                     +                         WA-Read-From             13220099
                 End-Compute                                            13230099
               End-If                                                   13240099
      *      ------------------------------------------------------     13250099
             When other                                                 13260099
      *                                                                 13270099
      * SEC-003 (CWE-1284/CWE-129/CWE-787): unlike the two branches
      * above, this one never capped Read-To against the table's 50-row
      * OCCURS limit (RTFRE120-O-Charge-Type-A), so U160-Iter-Output
      * could write past element 50 and corrupt adjacent Linkage-Section
      * memory. Honor the caller's explicit Read-From/Read-To when it
      * already fits the cap; clamp Read-To only when it would exceed it
      * (this preserves the caller's real request instead of always
      * substituting the maximal window, unlike an earlier draft of this
      * patch, which a reviewer flagged as an undisclosed behavior
      * change beyond the security fix).
      * REVIEWER: the sibling "When any also +0" branch's own clamp,
      * two cases above (unchanged by this patch), computes
      * "Charge-Type-A + Read-From" for its upper bound, which is
      * off-by-one for an inclusive window (should be
      * "Charge-Type-A - 1 + Read-From"); this patch uses the corrected
      * formula here but does not touch the pre-existing sibling branch,
      * which is outside SEC-003's cited lines - fix it too for
      * consistency once this hunk is reviewed.
      * Not handled: RTFRE120-B-Read-To-D < RTFRE120-B-Read-From-D (an
      * inverted window) is passed through unchanged, as it was before
      * this patch - U160-Iter-Output's own row-matching logic (outside
      * this hunk) determines whether that yields zero rows or needs its
      * own guard; not re-derived here.
               If  RTFRE120-B-Read-From-D <  +1
                 Move  +1                 To    RTFRE120-B-Read-From-D
               End-If
               Move  RTFRE120-B-Read-From-D                             13280099
                                         To    WA-Read-From             13290099
               Compute  WA-Difference  =  RTFRE120-B-Read-To-D
                                         -  WA-Read-From
               End-Compute
               If  WA-Difference  >  RTFRE120-O-Charge-Type-A - 1
                 Compute  WA-Read-To  =  RTFRE120-O-Charge-Type-A
                                      -  1
                                      +  WA-Read-From
                 End-Compute
               Else
                 Move  RTFRE120-B-Read-To-D  To  WA-Read-To
               End-If
      *      ------------------------------------------------------     13320099
           End-Evaluate                                                 13330099
      *                                                                 13340099
           Move  Zero                    To    RTFRE120-O-Charge-Type-A 13350099
           .                                                            13360099
      *                                                                 13370099
       U130-Adjust-Parameters-Ex.                                       13380099
           Exit.                                                        13390099
                                                                        13400099
      *################################################################*13410099
       U160-Iter-Output                  Section.                       13420099
      *                                                                 13430099
           If  SW-Write-New                                             13440099
             Add  +1                     To    WA-Ind-Out               13450099
           End-If                                                       13460099
      *                                                                 13470099
           Move 'U'                      To   RTFRE120-O-Charge-Type-O  13480099
                                                            (WA-Ind-Out)13490099
           Move WA-Charge-Type           To   RTFRE120-O-Charge-Type-D  13500099
                                                            (WA-Ind-Out)13510099
           Move 'U'                      To   RTFRE120-O-Description-O  13520099
                                                            (WA-Ind-Out)13530099
           Move WA-Description           To   RTFRE120-O-Description-D  13540099
                                                            (WA-Ind-Out)13550099
           Move 'U'                      To   RTFRE120-O-Selected-O     13560099
                                                            (WA-Ind-Out)13570099
           Move WA-Selected              To   RTFRE120-O-Selected-D     13580099
                                                            (WA-Ind-Out)13590099
      *                                                                 13591099
           If  WA-Charge-Text        >    Spaces                        13592099
             Move 'U'                    To   RTFRE120-O-Charge-text-O  13593099
                                                            (WA-Ind-Out)13594099
             Move WA-Charge-Text         To   RTFRE120-O-Charge-Text-D  13595099
                                                            (WA-Ind-Out)13596099
           End-If                                                       13597099
      *                                                                 13601099
           If  not WA-Amount             =    Zero                      13610099
             Move 'U'                    To   RTFRE120-O-Charge-Amount-O13620099
                                                            (WA-Ind-Out)13630099
             Move WA-Amount              To   RTFRE120-O-Charge-Amount-D13640099
                                                            (WA-Ind-Out)13650099
           End-If                                                       13660099
      *                                                                 13670099
           Move 'U'                      To   RTFRE120-O-Currency-O     13680099
                                                            (WA-Ind-Out)13690099
           Move WA-Currency              To   RTFRE120-O-Currency-D     13700099
                                                            (WA-Ind-Out)13710099
           Move 'U'                      To   RTFRE120-O-Paying-Party-O 13720099
                                                            (WA-Ind-Out)13730099
           Move WA-Paying-Party          To   RTFRE120-O-Paying-Party-D 13740099
                                                            (WA-Ind-Out)13750099
      *                                                                 13760099
           If  not WA-Percent-Comm       =    Zero                      13770099
             Move 'U'                    To   RTFRE120-O-Percent-Comm-O 13780099
                                                            (WA-Ind-Out)13790099
             Move WA-Percent-Comm        To   RTFRE120-O-Percent-Comm-D 13800099
                                                            (WA-Ind-Out)13810099
           End-If                                                       13820099
      *                                                                 13830099
           Move 'U'                      To    RTFRE120-O-Percent-O     13840099
                                                            (WA-Ind-Out)13850099
           Move WA-Percent               To    RTFRE120-O-Percent-D     13860099
                                                            (WA-Ind-Out)13870099
           .                                                            13880099
      *                                                                 13890099
       U160-Iter-Out-Fields-Ex.                                         13900099
           Exit.                                                        13910099
                                                                        13920099
      *################################################################*13930099
      *                                                                 13940099
      * Set Warning status                                             *13950099
      *                                                                *13960099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*13970099
      *<META Z600-ERROR-AW>                                             13980099
       Z600-Error-AW                     Section.                       13990099
      *                                                                 14000099
           Set   R7919999-Return-Warning To    True                     14010099
           Move  'FTFRL120'              To    R400CH01-Message-Text    14020099
